<title>USA: TechWorks buys manufacturing facility in Ireland.</title>
<headline>TechWorks buys manufacturing facility in Ireland.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>TechWorks Inc said on Monday that it bought a new manufacturing facility in Shannon, Ireland.</p>
<p>The purchase price was not disclosed.</p>
<p>TechWorks, a developer and manufacturer of high performance computer memory upgrade products, said the newly acquired manufacturing plant would enable the company to increase its manufacturing capacity.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
